1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,200
Here is the classic story.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:09,101
In nineteen twenty eight Karpechenko crossed radish with cabbage, nine chromosomes each per gamete.

3
00:00:09,101 --> 00:00:16,289
The hybrid had eighteen chromosomes, but nine radish and nine cabbage, so none could pair at meiosis.

4
00:00:16,289 --> 00:00:17,343
It was sterile.

